<item>
<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-06T08:05:45.332Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 08:05:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Kashmir are on high alert as IGP Sujit Kumar warns that drug-trade profits are funding terrorist networks and stresses the police are expanding beyond traditional security operations. In Manipur, Naga groups continue to petition Modi and hold large rallies demanding the withdrawal of Assam Rifles and the abrogation of the SoO pact, while security forces have uncovered a cache of arms and explosives in Imphal East and launched search-and-cordon operations after militant killings. In the Maoist-affected belt, security forces recovered 711 BGL shells hidden by Maoists in Bijapur and neutralised a 5 kg pressure-cooker IED in a forest area. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTTUxOGVqT2xwdUFTcHRmMUtzeFFSUXZCbG01UmQtT1pzY2hQcThmREpDejVacXMwd1Z1Z0gwWEdGc0ZWc21vZ3lPc1A0QjVDYlBMbkFxdF9sTnJzM1E1cThUVUs5djJOVU9DT1NHUW1jT0ZfWll6WHc1Ujk2VmdqSWI2dmIxTTdEMFNwalRneGY4ejRKejlTWTlzNmZBNGFDUEQ4RFJBVExLem81akpsMFNR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Northeast Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WION&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ETV Bharat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOemFSUl9SX3dPQnJsNzRRUExjX0I5WVBhTk1tZGpyMHNNQ3Z2N19Jb3dBV0laZy1DOUdXR0JVNy1oM2VmQmJDQ3pqeUllMFlsWmxWQ1JxaHAyLUp0b2s0aVNDaXpfcTl0LUlVLXFZSlhRb3M1OW5zUkR4MzQ3SjFsMkw4S2dNRnZGdXhyeEhpZlF4U0M0Y01YbVpLc2pDVWJYOTVZSndCQzJ0cms?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Vision&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Greater Kashmir&lt;